<title>USA: McKesson files amended 10-Q reports.</title>
<headline>McKesson files amended 10-Q reports.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>McKesson Corp said Friday that it filed amended Form 10-Qs with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the first three quarters of fiscal 1997, but that the changes did not affect results for the year.</p>
<p>The amended forms, said  the company, reclassify a portion of the purchase price for McKesson's April 1996 acquisition of Automated Healthcare Inc.</p>
<p>Charges related to the acquisition of $48.2 million, which were originally recorded in the company's third quarter ended December 31, 1996, are now included in the first quarter ended June 30, 1996, the same quarter as the acquisition.</p>
</text>
